Problem: Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array (LC 153)

Pattern: Binary Search (Rotated Sorted Array)

Approach:

Initialize:
left = 0
right = nums.size() - 1
While left < right:
Find mid.
Compare nums[mid] with nums[right]:
If nums[mid] > nums[right]:
Minimum lies in the right half.
left = mid + 1
Otherwise:
Minimum lies in the left half (including mid).
right = mid
When left == right, that index contains the minimum.
Return nums[left].

Time Complexity: O(log n)

Space Complexity: O(1)